/dev-notes

# The Elpy-derived placeholder pack. It IS bundled into local builds so there is
# something to test against, but it is not ours to publish, so the audio and art
# never get committed. Regenerate with `npm run pack:placeholder`.
# The folder itself stays tracked — Tauri fails the build if a declared resource
# directory is missing.
/resources/packs/elpy-placeholder/*
!/resources/packs/elpy-placeholder/README.md

# Frontend
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

